      <h1>Welcome to the trading platform</h1>
      <div class="text">
        <p>This is a cutting-edge and <a href="https://www.metatrader5.com/en/trading-platform?utm_source=mt5terminal&utm_medium=special&utm_campaign=en.mail.welcome" target="_blank">powerful trading platform</a> allowing traders of any level to achieve maximum results regardless of their trading style.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Flexible trading system supporting all types of orders and different execution modes</li>
          <li>Extensive analytical capabilities - 38 technical indicators and 44 analytical tools, as well as 21 time periods of charts - from minute to month</li>
          <li>Algorithmic trading — <a href="https://www.mql5.com/en/market?utm_source=mt5terminal&utm_medium=special&utm_campaign=en.mail.welcome" target="_blank">the largest store of trading apps</a> where you can purchase ready-to-use trading robots and indicators</li>
          <li>Trading signals — choose any of 11,000 <a href="https://www.mql5.com/en/signals?utm_source=mt5terminal&utm_medium=special&utm_campaign=en.mail.welcome" target="_blank">paid and free signals </a>, subscribe and copy provider's deals on your account</li>
          <li><a href="https://www.mql5.com/en/vps?utm_source=mt5terminal&utm_medium=special&utm_campaign=en.mail.welcome" target="_blank">Specialized hosting</a> for traders — minimal network delays will allow your Robots and Signals to trade 24/7 as efficiently as possible<br></li>
          <li>Professional MQL5 development environment — for creating, debugging, testing and executing trading robots and indicators of any complexity</li>
          <li><a href="https://www.mql5.com/en/job?utm_source=mt5terminal&utm_medium=special&utm_campaign=en.mail.welcome" target="_blank">Freelance</a> — hire a professional developer who will write a robot or indicator according to your requirements<br></li>
          <li><a href="https://www.mql5.com/en/forum/455279?utm_source=mt5terminal&utm_medium=special&utm_campaign=en.mail.welcome" target="_blank">Reports</a> will allow you to analyze your trading activity and find its strengths and weaknesses</li>
          <li>Payments — top up the deposit of a real account or withdraw money from it directly in the platform</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
